{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/522083-breath-eating-drinking","id":522083,"title":"Breath Eating/Drinking","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-20T11:22:04-07:00","id":522083,"title":"Breath Eating/Drinking","content":"So, it came to my attention that I'm a little unclear on certain particulars of the strix feeding mechanism. <br /> <br /> Firstly; If a strix is in a host and uses the Breath Eating power, does it roll Power or Strength? <br /> <br /> Secondly, is the grapple and &quot;bite&quot; the rules speak of one action or two? Does the victim take lethal damage equal to the successes as with a kindred bite or not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T05:44:34-07:00","id":523114,"title":"","content":"1) Yes, you'd use Strength (of the host form) for Breath Drinking. It never specifically calls this out, but it does liken the power to diablerie, which uses Strength. I believe the idea is that the strix is physically ripping the life force of the victim out through their breath, and it struggles not to be eaten.<br /> <br /> 2) When you grapple (pg. 117), you first establish the grapple with a Str + Brawl attack. On a success you are grappling, on an exceptional success you get to pick a grapple move immediately.<br /> <br /> During each grappler's turn they contest Str + Brawl, the winner gets to perform a grapple move (or two on an exceptional success). Vampires/strix can use the Damage move to bite, during which it can steal 1 vitae. Once they have bitten, they can use the Feed move (described on pg 94, not in the grapple section, somewhat annoyingly). Shadow form strix, or embodied strix with the Breath Drinker dread power use the Feed move to continue to steal breath.<br /> <br /> These are separate moves, so you have to win the grapple contest to apply them. It doesn't precisely take an action, but when you're grappling that's all you can do.<br /> <br /> Assuming no exceptional successes it takes three successful rolls for a strix to feed from a conscious opponent: 1. Establish grapple. 2. Bite. 3. Feed. An exceptional success lets them perform an extra step in the chain.<br /> <br /> As far as damage goes, unless the strix is Shadow Potency 7 and can materialize, its &quot;Bite&quot; isn't really a bite per se, so it deals no damage. If it can materialize its bite is 2L, dealing damage as normal for the Damage move.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":689,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","user":"Smarmy Vamp","date":".  Fixed the section on Bite to note the 1 vitae you can take as part of the move. 05-21-2015, 09:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","name":"Smarmy Vamp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T06:18:27-07:00","id":523118,"title":"","content":"OK, that all makes sense, thanks. <br /> <br /> Although a materialized strix would likely not bother with breath drinking when it can just <i>eat</i> you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T06:29:29-07:00","id":523125,"title":"","content":"My pleasure. <br /> <br /> Well, sometimes you want efficiency, and to savor the look in your victim's eye as he sees his life flow out of his mouth like cigarette smoke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","name":"Smarmy Vamp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}